Skia: "Fix integer overflow and oversized glyph rasterization in SDF
generation" (crbugs 581211720 and b/576664769, not public; no CVE listed
yet): a font with an oversized glyph could overflow the distance field
buffer size computation (SkComputeDistanceFieldSize, SkDistanceFieldGen),
and the remote glyph cache rasterized glyphs larger than the atlas. Skia
main commit 3d70807b9548ec53b4d201afc3094fdfc73af572, merged on 2026-11-03
to Skia's chrome/m157 branch (8bc8a8fb495665040f771a3477a0a875b9e80b43; not
yet rolled into the 157 branch) and proposed for chrome/m156. This is that
merge, at third_party/skia/, without its tests. Drop it once a 157 tag's
Skia has it.

